							<div class=3D"subSectionDesc">
								Using <b><a class=3D"bb_link" href=3D"http://paint.net/" target=3D"=
_blank" rel=3D" noopener">Paint.NET</a></b> (or whatever other imaged edito=
r you using), open the copy of the screenshot you saved earlier.<br><br>Ove=
rall, here is what you need to accomplish at this stage:<br><ul class=3D"bb=
_ul"><li> Open the screenshot.<br></li><li> Resize it to a <b>width</b> of =
(<i>exactly</i>) <b>256 pixels</b>.<br></li><li> Allow the <b>height</b> to=
 be <i>resized proportionally</i> automatically.<br></li><li> Resize the im=
age "canvas" to be <i>exactly</i> <b>256x256</b> pixels, the with existing =
image contents being <i>centered</i> on the newly-expanded canvas.<br></li>=
<li> Optionally, darken the image some to allow the (later added) text to s=
tand-out better.<br></li><li> Optionally, overlay text on the <b>center</b>=
 of the image - containing <i><b>name</b> of the map</i>.<br></li><li> Save=
 the image someplace you can find it later.</li></ul>Specifically, in <b><a=
 class=3D"bb_link" href=3D"http://paint.net/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D" noo=
pener">Paint.NET</a></b> that is accomplished by doing this:<br><ul class=
=3D"bb_ul"><li> Open the screenshot.<br></li><li> Select the"<b>Resize...</=
b> option from the <b>Image</b> menu.<br></li><li> Set the <b>Width</b> opt=
ion to <b>256</b> pixels.<br><a href=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com=
/ugc/36697142553515985/B095593C06D86BCEA3BF1DC7CD2D5A0663D01F57/" class=3D"=
modalContentLink" data-modal-content-popup-url=3D"https://steamcommunity.co=
m/sharedfiles/displayimageformodaldialog/?imageurl=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fimages.s=
teamusercontent.com%2Fugc%2F36697142553515985%2FB095593C06D86BCEA3BF1DC7CD2=
D5A0663D01F57%2F"><img src=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/36697=
142553515985/B095593C06D86BCEA3BF1DC7CD2D5A0663D01F57/" class=3D"sharedFile=
PreviewImage sizeThumb inline" alt=3D"" title=3D""></a><br></li><li> Click =
<b>Ok</b> to apply the image resize change.<br></li><li> Select the"<b>Canv=
as size...</b> option from the <b>Image</b> menu.<br></li><li> Set the <b>H=
eight</b> option to <b>256</b> pixels.<br></li><li> Ensure the <b>Anchor</b=
> option is set to <b>Middle</b>.<br></li><li> Ensure the <b>Fill</b> optio=
n is set to <b>Black</b>.<br><a href=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com=
/ugc/36697142553515986/F5DB73C79B2F95152600AB3D33F8D2C63B1401F3/" class=3D"=
modalContentLink" data-modal-content-popup-url=3D"https://steamcommunity.co=
m/sharedfiles/displayimageformodaldialog/?imageurl=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fimages.s=
teamusercontent.com%2Fugc%2F36697142553515986%2FF5DB73C79B2F95152600AB3D33F=
8D2C63B1401F3%2F"><img src=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/36697=
142553515986/F5DB73C79B2F95152600AB3D33F8D2C63B1401F3/" class=3D"sharedFile=
PreviewImage sizeThumb inline" alt=3D"" title=3D""></a><br></li><li> Click =
<b>Ok</b> to apply the canvas resize change.<br></li><li> Select the"<b>Bri=
ghtness / Contrast</b> option from the <b>Adjustments</b> menu.<br></li><li=
> Adjust the <b>Brightness</b> option to darken the image some (in particul=
ar if it is an outdoor daylight map) to allow the text (that you will apply=
 next) show to better.<br><a href=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com/ug=
c/36697142553515991/7F5517A6999AB5E0BFCF039AB7D076F8AAF93204/" class=3D"mod=
alContentLink" data-modal-content-popup-url=3D"https://steamcommunity.com/s=
haredfiles/displayimageformodaldialog/?imageurl=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fimages.stea=
musercontent.com%2Fugc%2F36697142553515991%2F7F5517A6999AB5E0BFCF039AB7D076=
F8AAF93204%2F"><img src=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/36697142=
