ect the <b>Text</b> tool from the left-side tool-bar (Hint: It looks like a=
 capital "T").<br></li><li> Click on the image, type the name of the map.  =
Reposition the resultant text as needed to get it approximately centered.<b=
r></li><li> Save the (now resized, darkened and labeled) image someplace yo=
u can find it later.</li></ul>The evolution of the image (from screenshot t=
o thumbnail) should look something like this:<br><a href=3D"https://images.=
