07A404D/" class=3D"sharedFilePreviewImage sizeThumb inline" alt=3D"" title=
=3D""></a><br></li><li> Optionally, on the <b>Resources</b> tab, enable the=
 <b>Create Information Resource</b> option and fill-out the information in =
a similar manner as shown in this image - but with whatever information of =
your own that you think would be appropriate:<br><a href=3D"https://images.=
steamusercontent.com/ugc/36697142557474283/0DC7DA3BAC959F80068B45F0E05A3752=
