 class=3D"sharedFilePreviewImage sizeThumb inline" alt=3D"" title=3D""></a>=
<br></li><li> Click the <b>Ok</b> button to close the <b>VTF Options</b> di=
alog.<br></li><li> The screen should then look something like what is shown=
 in the following images:<br><a href=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com=
/ugc/36697142557474277/FC5B5972B97B1A72B18FC0377904680AB7768CE8/" class=3D"=
modalContentLink" data-modal-content-popup-url=3D"https://steamcommunity.co=
m/sharedfiles/displayimageformodaldialog/?imageurl=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fimages.s=
teamusercontent.com%2Fugc%2F36697142557474277%2FFC5B5972B97B1A72B18FC037790=
4680AB7768CE8%2F"><img src=3D"https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/36697=
142557474277/FC5B5972B97B1A72B18FC0377904680AB7768CE8/" class=3D"sharedFile=
PreviewImage sizeThumb inline" alt=3D"" title=3D""></a><br><a href=3D"https=
