							<div class=3D"subSectionTitle">
								6 - Getting the thumbnail(s) to players																<span class=
=3D"subSectionEditLink"><a href=3D"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/e=
ditguidesubsection/?id=3D3445083893&amp;sectionid=3D7794210">Edit</a></span=
>
